# Gateway logo

The `/` idle screen (`GatewayIdle`) must render `LogoAnimated` — the GSAP draw-on plus eye wiggle.

Do not replace it with `LogoStatic`. `LogoStatic` is path data for `LogoAnimated` and the nav mark, not the gateway lockup.
